                99
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "algorithm",
            "content": {
                "algorithm_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Theorem 15.3 Algorithm 15.2 achieves an approximation factor of "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f ."
                    }
                ],
                "algorithm_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Algorithm 15.2 (Set cover - factor  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ")\n1. Initialization:  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x \\leftarrow 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ";  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y \\leftarrow 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "\n2. Until all elements are covered, do:\n    Pick an uncovered element, say  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", and raise  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y_e"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " until some set goes tight.\n    Pick all tight sets in the cover and update  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ".\n    Declare all the elements occurring in these sets as “covered”.\n3. Output the set cover  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                226,
                112,
                784,
                263
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Proof: Clearly there will be no uncovered elements and no overpacked sets at the end of the algorithm. Thus, the primal and dual solutions will both be feasible. Since they satisfy the relaxed complementary slackness conditions with "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\alpha = f"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", by Proposition 15.1 the approximation factor is "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f ."
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "✷"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                220,
                302,
                786,
                361
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Example 15.4 A tight example for this algorithm is provided by the following set system:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                220,
                373,
                784,
                404
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/6ff5135f4f8ff85aad6fd5205ea8818df323723ad127844a0e3a2ced73513ea8.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                253,
                419,
                752,
                615
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Here, "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "s"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "consists of "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "n - 1"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "sets of cost 1, "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\{ e _ { 1 } , e _ { n } \\} , \\ldots , \\{ e _ { n - 1 } , e _ { n } \\}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", and one set of cost "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "1 + \\varepsilon , \\{ e _ { 1 } , \\ldots , e _ { n + 1 } \\}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", for a small "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\varepsilon > 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ". Since "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e _ { n }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "appears in all n sets, this set system has "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f = n ."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                220,
                625,
                784,
                668
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Suppose the algorithm raises "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y _ { e _ { n } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "in the first iteration. When "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y _ { e _ { n } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "is raised to 1, all sets "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\{ e _ { i } , e _ { n } \\} , i = 1 , \\dots , n - 1"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "go tight. They are all picked in the cover, thus covering the elements "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e _ { 1 } , \\ldots , e _ { n }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ". In the second iteration, "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y _ { e _ { n + 1 } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "is raised to ε and the set "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\{ e _ { 1 } , \\ldots , e _ { n + 1 } \\}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "goes tight. The resulting set cover has a cost of "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "n + \\varepsilon ,"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", whereas the optimum cover has cost "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "1 + \\varepsilon"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "✷"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                220,
                669,
                786,
                740
            ]
        },
